Id: lin042w
Severity: WARN
Category: packages
Check: deb_nopackfiles
Controls: CIS 2.3; NIST SI-7, CM-11; ISO 8.19

Packages are removed but not purged: their configuration files remain
in place, owned by root, and apply again the moment the package is
reinstalled. Stale configuration has surprised administrators that
way, re-enabling services and access they thought were gone. Purge
what is not wanted.
